{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56639","headline":"赠别毕道士 · 无名氏","name":"赠别毕道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜梦海上羣仙山。\n旦逢瀛洲道士还。\n凭风倚景长叹息，弥怜昨夜云峰邑。\n霓裳羽旆惜分飞，方外人间此日违。\n君不见辽东华表柱，但有空歌丁令威。\n（同前第五六二页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}